WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.033 --> 00:00:03.933
[music]

2
00:00:05.733 --> 00:00:09.366
[Instructor] Now we've added
"Text Mesh Pro" to our project,

3
00:00:09.366 --> 00:00:12.800
and we've created our "Score Text,"
and repositioned it.

4
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:16.200
Now other things that we can do
with our Text Mesh Pro Elements,

5
00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.366
is we have this section
down here.

6
00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:21.900
And we can actually change the text,

7
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:24.200
so what we'll set it to be
for now will just

8
00:00:24.266 --> 00:00:27.900
be "Score: " and keep track
of the score.

9
00:00:28.366 --> 00:00:31.866
Under main settings,
you can see that we can change the font.

10
00:00:31.866 --> 00:00:34.066
So, if you click on
this little circle icon,

11
00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:37.200
it will bring up different
options that you can choose from.

12
00:00:41.766 --> 00:00:45.133
Kind of like this IndieFlower one.
So we'll use that one.

13
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.600
You can select different things,
like if you want it to be bold,

14
00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:51.933
or if you want it to be italicized,
I kind of just like it fine for now.

15
00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:54.666
You can even change the font size.

16
00:00:54.666 --> 00:00:59.400
So if I wanted to change
it to something even larger

17
00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:02.466
or if I wanted to make it smaller,
20, make it really tiny.

18
00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:06.700
And then if you want to,
you can change the "Vertex" color,

19
00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:09.700
so actually if you just
click on the white box,

20
00:01:10.166 --> 00:01:12.633
you can actually change
the color of your font too.

21
00:01:12.633 --> 00:01:14.600
So if you want it to be red,
like bright red,

22
00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:19.033
or a really dark black if you're
on a white background, whichever one.

23
00:01:19.566 --> 00:01:22.066
But I think white
is totally fine for now,

24
00:01:22.066 --> 00:01:26.533
so we'll just leave it for white.
So, what you're going to do,

25
00:01:26.566 --> 00:01:29.233
is you're going to go to the Score Text,

26
00:01:29.833 --> 00:01:34.000
change the text 
in your text box to be "Score: "

27
00:01:34.766 --> 00:01:38.933
And then what you can do is
select one of your font assets

28
00:01:38.933 --> 00:01:43.766
using this little circular radio button,
to be whatever font you'd like it to be.

29
00:01:45.366 --> 00:01:48.566
You can make your font bold,
or italic, or underlined.

30
00:01:49.666 --> 00:01:51.666
You can change the font size.

31
00:01:51.933 --> 00:01:54.333
And then if you want you can
change the Vertex color

32
00:01:54.333 --> 00:01:56.400
by clicking on the white box

33
00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:58.533
and selecting any one
of the different colors

34
00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:02.166
that you might like.
So, now it's your turn.

35
00:02:03.466 --> 00:02:06.233
[music]
